WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.902
Looking for a place nearby?

00:00:01.902 --> 00:00:03.100
Start with the map.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.117
Tap a price, then open the home.

00:00:05.117 --> 00:00:07.450
Everything in this demo is fictional.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:09.782
Have a place to rent out?

00:00:09.782 --> 00:00:11.313
Choose List your place.

00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:16.042
Add the details, location, photos and costs, then submit it for review.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.169
Already have a renter?

00:00:18.169 --> 00:00:20.440
Open My Rentals and add your room.

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.045
Let's use eight thousand pesos a month.

00:00:23.045 --> 00:00:25.650
Check the rent and dates before saving.

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:30.233
Next, invite your renter using their Google sign in email.

00:00:30.233 --> 00:00:34.950
Check the details, create the invitation, and share the link yourself.

00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:37.207
Here's the renter's side.

00:00:37.207 --> 00:00:41.406
Open the invitation, check the owner, rent and dates, then accept.

00:00:41.406 --> 00:00:42.742
You're now connected.

00:00:43.408 --> 00:00:46.433
Back with the owner, create a monthly rent bill.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:49.268
Check the covered dates, amount and due date.

00:00:49.268 --> 00:00:51.158
Both people can see this bill.

00:00:51.825 --> 00:00:56.030
For an agreed calendar month cycle, you can turn on monthly bills.

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:59.407
Review the first full month and rent before enabling.

00:00:59.407 --> 00:01:01.255
Pause them whenever you need.

00:01:01.255 --> 00:01:02.975
This does not deduct money.

00:01:03.658 --> 00:01:07.740
You can still pay the owner directly by bank, wallet, or cash.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:10.242
After paying, choose Report a payment.

00:01:10.242 --> 00:01:15.508
Check the filled in details, change any partial amount, and add a new reference.

00:01:16.158 --> 00:01:18.601
Here is a three thousand peso report.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:23.883
While it is awaiting confirmation, the recorded balance stays at eight thousand.

00:01:24.533 --> 00:01:26.956
Owners now check reports in one list.

00:01:26.956 --> 00:01:32.325
Compare the amount and reference with your original records, then confirm receipt.

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.533
Three thousand confirmed, and five thousand left.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:39.518
Already received the remaining five thousand in cash?

00:01:39.518 --> 00:01:42.397
Record it here and confirm you've received it.

00:01:42.397 --> 00:01:44.150
Now the bill is marked Paid.

00:01:44.825 --> 00:01:48.588
Open Payment history to see who reported and confirmed.

00:01:48.588 --> 00:01:49.614
Made a mistake?

00:01:49.614 --> 00:01:52.078
Use a correction and leave a reason.

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.925
The original history stays.

00:01:54.575 --> 00:01:57.158
Want to see the proposed online option?

00:01:57.158 --> 00:01:58.615
Open the payment demo.

00:01:58.615 --> 00:02:02.787
Tap the example reminder, choose a method, and try an approval.

00:02:02.787 --> 00:02:06.826
This is a fictional preview, not a connected payment service.

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.475
No real payment or notification is sent.

00:02:10.158 --> 00:02:12.815
Both people keep the same rent history.

00:02:12.815 --> 00:02:15.063
Direct payments remain available.

00:02:15.063 --> 00:02:18.673
Online checkout and phone reminders are still a demo.

00:02:18.673 --> 00:02:21.533
Nothing in this tutorial moves real money.
